    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Rallying Speech.</strong> You can deliver a short, targeted speech that makes people remember why you’re here.</p><ul><li>As a bonus action, choose one creature other than yourself within 6 squares who can see or hear you. That creature gains a bonus to the next attack roll, attribute check, or defense check it makes before the start of your next turn. The bonus equals your Presence value (minimum +1).</li><li>You can use this feature a number of times per Soma Break equal to your tier.</li></ul>",
